From b47293b2a0619ef51d148651e4417ebcde298b88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: girayk <girayk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 02:29:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(council): named members with roles (karpathy-style
 council personas)

- Member slots gain optional name + role; judge/chairman gain optional name
- role steers stage-1 via a per-member system message; stage-2 stays fully
  anonymous (sentinel tests prove no name/role/model-id leak into reviews)
- 'NAME (provider:model)' labels in guidance, events, banner, CLI list,
  live stream rendering; desktop Member blocks get Name/Role inputs with
  debounced autosave; council.member payload carries name
- tests: 16 council-loop (incl. 2 anonymity guards) + 13 council-config,
  MoA suites untouched and green
